        "Express $x$ in terms of $y$ on the domain $x \\ge -2$ ($x + 2 \\ge 0$):\n$$(x + 2)^2 = y + 1 \\implies x + 2 = \\sqrt{y + 1} \\implies x = -2 + \\sqrt{y + 1} \\quad (\\text{or } -2 + (y + 1)^{1/2})$$"
      ],
